	)
	(text "ENVELOPE UI (Bread Modular ENV): MODE (PC0) + LEDs HR/AR/ASR (PC1, PA4, PA5);\nREC (PC2) + LED (PC3) records the knob positions (8bit crash style). Internal pull-ups."
